===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|architecture|military|historical}} Any of the [[upright#Adjective|upright]] [[projection]]s between the [[embrasure]]s of a [[battlement]], originally for [[archer]]s to [[shield#Verb|shield]] behind while [[shoot#Verb|shooting]] [[arrow]]s over the embrasures, or through [[loophole]]s in the merlons.
#: {{synonyms|en|{{l|en|cop|id=merlon}}|embattle|q2=heraldry}}

